    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 188942,
        "name": {
          "full": "Ling Wang",
          "native": "王令",
          "alternative": [
            "Consultant Wang"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188942-9ypZJN7MCFk2.png"
        },
        "description": "Wang Ling is a cultivation genius who reaches a new realm every two years since he was one year old, Wang Ling has an almost invincible existence with strength far beyond his control.\n\nWang Ling is a non-talkative individual who‘s obsessed with being average and not standing out. He tries to avoid troublesome matters yet he still manages to get involved and has also secretly saved the world on numerous accounts. He also lives for and loves his crispy noodles. \n\nHe's a genius who has a vast amount of knowledge ranging from simple things to complex concepts such as multiple cultivation systems, techniques, various theories be them resolved or not, space-time and laws. He is calm and collected and most of the time his actions have a plan behind them even if they a lot of time get in weird situations.",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": []
    },
